# Upstream-sync merge policy. Consumed by .github/workflows/upstream-sync.yml
# when it merges nanocoai/nanoclaw main into this fork's main.
#
# These rules ONLY make merges auto-resolve for paths where taking a blanket
# side is always safe. Fork core seams (Band adapter, router, migrations,
# container-runner, providers) are deliberately NOT listed — they must always
# conflict and get human judgment.

# Append-only docs: keep BOTH sides' added lines, never conflict on additions.
CHANGELOG.md       merge=union

# Generated artifacts the fork never hand-edits: always take upstream's version.
# `theirs` is a custom driver the sync workflow registers before merging.
repo-tokens/badge.svg   merge=theirs
